{%- comment -%}
  Tapi FAQ — a single source of honest Q&A rendered BOTH as a visible accordion
  (native <details>, so it matches the rest of the site and needs no JS) AND as
  FAQPage JSON-LD built from the same data, so the structured data always matches
  what's on the page (a requirement for valid FAQPage markup).

  Content is delimited: each pair is `question:::answer`, pairs joined by `|||`.
  Voice: honest, premium, plain. No em/en dashes, no handcraft claims.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture faq_data -%}
How long will delivery take?:::Orders are dispatched within 1 to 2 business days and usually arrive in 3 to 7 business days, depending on where you are. You will get a tracking link as soon as your order ships.|||
How much does shipping cost?:::Delivery is free on every prepaid or partly paid order. Cash on Delivery carries a delivery fee, which you see at checkout before you confirm.|||
How can I pay? Is Cash on Delivery available?:::You can pay online by UPI, card, or net banking, and when you do, delivery is free and you save 5%. Cash on Delivery is available across India too; the COD delivery fee is shown at checkout before you confirm. Paying online means we can dispatch a little sooner, and the savings are yours to keep.|||
Can I return or exchange something?:::Yes. If a piece arrives with a defect or it is the wrong item, tell us within 7 days of delivery and we arrange the pickup and a replacement or refund at no cost to you. Changed your mind, or want a different size or colour? As long as the piece is unworn and unwashed, we still book the pickup for you; the return courier cost simply comes off your refund and you keep the rest, then you reorder the size you want and we hold it aside so it does not sell out. We cannot take pieces back once they have been worn or washed, so do check the size guide first.|||
How do I find my size?:::Every product page links to our size guide with bust, waist, and hip measurements. Because our pieces come from a handful of trusted ateliers, measurements can vary by about 2 to 3 inches between styles, so pick the size you usually wear and use the chart as a guide.|||
How should I care for my pieces?:::Care depends on the fabric, and every product lists its own wash care. As a rule, a gentle cold hand wash and drying in the shade keeps colour and texture at their best. Our fabric guide explains each fabric in more detail.|||
Will the colour and fabric match the photos?:::We photograph each piece as honestly as we can, and we name the fabric on every product so you know what you are getting. Screens vary, so a slight difference in shade is normal.|||
How do I reach you?:::Write to us at support@morpaankh.in and we will get back to you, usually within a working day. You can also message us on WhatsApp at +91 93727 10234 or on Instagram at @morpaankh_collection.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign faq_items = faq_data | strip | split: '|||' -%}

<section id="faq" class="tapi-faq" aria-label="{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Frequently asked questions' }}">
  <div class="page-width tapi-faq__inner">
    <header class="tapi-faq__head">
      <span class="tapi-eyebrow tapi-eyebrow--line">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'Good to know' }}</span>
      <h2 class="tapi-faq__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Questions, answered.' }}</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="tapi-faq__list">
      {%- for item in faq_items -%}
        {%- assign parts = item | strip | split: ':::' -%}
        {%- assign q = parts[0] | strip -%}
        {%- assign a = parts[1] | strip -%}
        {%- if q != blank and a != blank -%}
          <details class="tapi-faq__item">
            <summary class="tapi-faq__q">
              <span>{{ q }}</span>
              <span class="tapi-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tapi-faq__a"><p>{{ a }}</p></div>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- assign first = true -%}
    {%- for item in faq_items -%}
      {%- assign parts = item | strip | split: ':::' -%}
      {%- assign q = parts[0] | strip -%}
      {%- assign a = parts[1] | strip -%}
      {%- if q != blank and a != blank -%}
        {%- unless first %},{% endunless -%}{%- assign first = false -%}
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": {{ q | json }},
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a | json }} }
        }
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>

<script>
  /* Smoothly bring the FAQ into view when arriving via /pages/contact#faq
     (footer link) — both on first load and on same-page hash changes. */
  (function () {
    var go = function () {
      if (location.hash !== '#faq') return;
      var el = document.getElementById('faq');
      if (!el) return;
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      requestAnimationFrame(function () {
        el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'start' });
      });
    };
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', go);
    else go();
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', go);
  })();
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* scroll-margin clears the sticky header when navigating to /pages/contact#faq */
  .tapi-faq { background: var(--mor-cream); padding-block: var(--section-pad-md); scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height, 80px) + 2rem); } /* md content tier — see theme-variables.css */
  .tapi-faq__inner { max-width: 76rem; }
  .tapi-faq__head { margin-bottom: 3.2rem; }
  .tapi-faq__heading { font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: var(--mor-h2); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.012em; line-height: var(--mor-leading-snug); margin: 1.2rem 0 0; color: var(--mor-charcoal); }
  .tapi-faq__list { border-top: 1px solid var(--tapi-hairline); }
  .tapi-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tapi-hairline); }
  .tapi-faq__q {
    list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2.4rem 0; font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2vw, 2rem); font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--mor-charcoal); transition: color var(--mor-dur-base) var(--mor-ease);
  }
  .tapi-faq__q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .tapi-faq__q:hover { color: var(--mor-accent); }
  .tapi-faq__icon { position: relative; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .tapi-faq__icon::before, .tapi-faq__icon::after { content: ""; position: absolute; background: currentColor; transition: transform var(--mor-dur-base) var(--mor-ease), opacity var(--mor-dur-base) var(--mor-ease); }
  .tapi-faq__icon::before { top: 7px; left: 0; width: 16px; height: 1.5px; }
  .tapi-faq__icon::after  { top: 0; left: 7px; width: 1.5px; height: 16px; }
  .tapi-faq__item[open] .tapi-faq__icon::after { transform: scaleY(0); opacity: 0; }
  .tapi-faq__a { padding: 0 0 2.6rem; max-width: 62ch; }
  .tapi-faq__a p { margin: 0; color: var(--mor-text-muted); font-size: var(--mor-text-base); line-height: var(--mor-leading-body); }
  .tapi-faq__item[open] .tapi-faq__q { color: var(--mor-accent); }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Good to know" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Questions, answered." }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "FAQ" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
